# JobBot

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) as the source of project policy.

Critical reminders:
- `data/profile.yaml` is the only professional source of truth.
- Never invent experience to match a job.
- LinkedIn: audit + publications sync; post sweep is discovery-only (writes are on ATS with `--apply` + confirm).
- Indeed writes need `--apply` + confirmation.
- Market feedback may suggest baseline rephrases; gaps require user confirmation before promote.
- No CAPTCHA/2FA bypass, stealth, or telemetry.
- Never commit real PII: `data/profile.yaml` stays gitignored; use `*.example.yaml` in git.
- Private LaTeX: only `latex/cv.tex.demo` is tracked; real `latex/cv.tex` / external vitae stay private.
- Complete the current phase vertical before expanding scope.
- **Every failure/bug fix must include a regression unit test** (fail first, then fix).
